#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:9
msgid "Backends and Presets"
msgstr "后端与预设"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:13
msgid ""
"This page is the source of truth for the ``isaaclab-selecting-backends`` and"
" ``isaaclab-using-presets`` agent skills (`skills/user/select-backends/ "
"<../../../skills/user/select-backends/SKILL.md>`__, `skills/user/use-"
"presets/ <../../../skills/user/use-presets/SKILL.md>`__). When you change "
"this page, update those skills so agent guidance stays in sync. See "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills`."
msgstr ""
"本页是 ``isaaclab-selecting-backends`` 和 ``isaaclab-using-presets`` 智能体技能的权威依据（"
" `skills/user/select-backends/ <../../../skills/user/select-"
"backends/SKILL.md>`__ 、 `skills/user/use-presets/ <../../../skills/user/use-"
"presets/SKILL.md>`__ ）。修改本页时，请同步更新这些技能，保证智能体指导与文档一致。请参阅 "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:20
msgid ""
"An Isaac Lab environment describes the robot, scene, sensors, and task. A "
"**backend** supplies the physics or rendering implementation that brings "
"that description to life. A **preset** is a named, tested configuration "
"choice that lets you switch implementations or task modes without editing "
"Python."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 环境描述机器人、场景、传感器和任务。 **后端** 提供使这些描述实际运行起来的物理或渲染实现。 **预设** "
"是具有名称、经过测试的配置选项，可在不修改 Python 代码的情况下切换实现或任务模式。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:25
msgid ""
"In practice, the same environment can run with a different physics engine, "
"renderer, or observation mode by adding a short selector:"
msgstr "实际使用时，只需添加一个简短的选择器，就能让同一环境使用不同的物理引擎、渲染器或观测模式："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:33
msgid ""
"The task stays ``Isaac-Cartpole-Direct``. The preset changes the "
"configuration used to launch it."
msgstr "任务仍是 ``Isaac-Cartpole-Direct`` ，预设改变的是启动任务时使用的配置。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:38
msgid "The mental model"
msgstr "理解环境与预设"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:40
msgid ""
"Think of an environment as the experiment and presets as the knobs that "
"select tested versions of its larger building blocks:"
msgstr "可以将环境看作实验，将预设看作用于选择其主要组件配置的开关；这些配置均经过测试："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:50
msgid ""
"After configuration is resolved, Isaac Lab's common asset, sensor, and scene"
" APIs dispatch to the selected backend implementation. Environment code can "
"use the same public API across PhysX, Newton, and OvPhysX instead of "
"branching on the active engine throughout the task."
msgstr ""
"配置解析完成后，Isaac Lab 通用的资源、传感器和场景 API 会调用选定的后端实现。环境代码可以跨 PhysX、Newton 和 OvPhysX"
" 使用相同的公共 API，无需在任务各处根据当前引擎编写分支。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:55
msgid ""
"Physics, rendering, and visualization are separate choices. For example, a "
"camera environment can use Newton physics with the Newton Warp renderer, "
"while the visualizer is selected independently with ``--viz``."
msgstr ""
"物理、渲染和可视化可以分别选择。例如，相机环境可以使用 Newton 物理与 Newton Warp 渲染器，再通过 ``--viz`` "
"独立选择可视化器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:61
msgid "Find what a task supports"
msgstr "查看任务支持的选项"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:63
msgid ""
"Preset support is task-specific. Before choosing a name, ask the task what "
"it offers:"
msgstr "不同任务支持的预设有所不同。选择名称之前，先查看任务提供哪些预设："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:71
msgid ""
"The help output groups names by ``physics=``, ``renderer=``, and "
"``presets=``. To browse all registered environments and their presets at "
"once, run:"
msgstr ""
"帮助信息会按 ``physics=`` 、 ``renderer=`` 和 ``presets=`` "
"分组列出名称。要一次查看所有已注册的环境及其预设，请运行："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:78
msgid ""
"An empty preset list is not an error. It means that the environment uses its"
" registered default configuration and does not expose alternatives. Passing "
"a name that a task does not list is unsupported and fails during "
"configuration validation."
msgstr "预设列表为空并非错误，而是表示环境使用注册时的默认配置，没有提供其他选项。传入任务未列出的名称属于不受支持的配置，会在配置验证时失败。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:85
msgid "Choose a selector"
msgstr "选用合适的选择器"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:91
msgid "Selector"
msgstr "选择器"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:92
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:93
msgid "What it changes"
msgstr "修改内容"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:94
msgid "``physics=NAME``"
msgstr "``physics=NAME``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:95
msgid "``physics=newton_mjwarp``"
msgstr "``physics=newton_mjwarp``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:96
msgid "Selects a physics configuration, including its backend and solver."
msgstr "选择物理配置，包括后端和求解器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:97
msgid "``renderer=NAME``"
msgstr "``renderer=NAME``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:98
msgid "``renderer=newton_renderer``"
msgstr "``renderer=newton_renderer``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:99
msgid "Selects a renderer configuration for tasks that produce camera data."
msgstr "为产生相机数据的任务选择渲染器配置。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:100
msgid "``presets=NAME[,NAME,...]``"
msgstr "``presets=NAME[,NAME,...]``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:101
msgid "``presets=rgb``"
msgstr "``presets=rgb``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:102
msgid ""
"Applies task-specific choices such as observation modes, camera layouts, or "
"compatible configuration bundles."
msgstr "应用任务专用选项，例如观测模式、相机布局或兼容的配置组合。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:105
msgid ""
"These are Hydra tokens, so append them without leading dashes. They work "
"with training, playback, and environment scripts that use Isaac Lab's task "
"configuration launcher."
msgstr ""
"这些是 Hydra 配置项，直接追加到命令末尾，不要添加前导短横线。使用 Isaac Lab 任务配置启动器的训练、策略运行和环境脚本均支持它们。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:109
msgid ""
"Selectors can be combined. This command chooses Newton with the MuJoCo-Warp "
"solver, the Newton Warp renderer, and RGB observations:"
msgstr ""
"选择器可以组合使用。以下命令选择使用 MuJoCo-Warp 求解器的 Newton 后端、Newton Warp 渲染器，以及 RGB 观测："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:118
msgid ""
"Only combine values listed for the task. Some physics, renderer, sensor, and"
" observation configurations are incompatible, and the task may reject an "
"invalid combination with a focused error message."
msgstr "仅组合任务明确列出的选项。部分物理、渲染器、传感器和观测配置彼此不兼容，任务可能拒绝无效组合，并给出具体错误信息。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:124
msgid "Common backend choices"
msgstr "常用后端选项"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:126
msgid ""
"The exact list depends on the environment, but these names follow shared "
"conventions:"
msgstr "具体列表取决于环境，但这些名称遵循共同约定："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:129
msgid "Physics presets"
msgstr "物理预设"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:133
#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:154
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:134
#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:155
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:135
msgid "``isaacsim_physx``"
msgstr "``isaacsim_physx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:136
msgid ""
"Concrete Isaac Sim PhysX configuration. This is the default for tasks whose "
"established default is Isaac Sim PhysX."
msgstr "明确指定的 Isaac Sim PhysX 配置，适用于既有默认后端为 Isaac Sim PhysX 的任务。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:138
msgid "``physx``"
msgstr "``physx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:139
msgid ""
"Automatic PhysX-family selection. Isaac Sim PhysX is used when the runtime "
"needs Kit; a configured OvPhysX alternative can be used for fully kit-less "
"runs."
msgstr ""
"自动选择 PhysX 系列实现。运行时需要 Kit 时使用 Isaac Sim PhysX；完全不使用 Kit 时，可以选用已配置的 OvPhysX "
"实现。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:142
msgid "``newton_mjwarp``"
msgstr "``newton_mjwarp``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:143
msgid "Newton physics with the MuJoCo-Warp solver."
msgstr "使用 MuJoCo-Warp 求解器的 Newton 物理后端。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:144
msgid "``newton_kamino``"
msgstr "``newton_kamino``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:145
msgid ""
"Newton physics with the Kamino solver. Support is beta and currently limited"
" to selected tasks and compatible assets."
msgstr "使用 Kamino 求解器的 Newton 物理后端。目前处于测试阶段，仅支持部分任务和兼容资源。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:147
msgid "``ovphysx``"
msgstr "``ovphysx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:148
msgid "Concrete OvPhysX configuration for supported kit-less tasks."
msgstr "明确指定的 OvPhysX 配置，适用于受支持且不依赖 Kit 的任务。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:150
msgid "Renderer presets"
msgstr "渲染器预设"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:156
msgid "``isaacsim_rtx``"
msgstr "``isaacsim_rtx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:157
msgid ""
"Concrete Isaac Sim RTX renderer configuration. This is the default for tasks"
" that use the multi-backend renderer preset."
msgstr "明确指定的 Isaac Sim RTX 渲染器配置，是使用多后端渲染器预设的任务的默认配置。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:159
msgid "``rtx``"
msgstr "``rtx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:160
msgid ""
"Automatic RTX-family selection. Isaac Sim RTX is used when physics, "
"visualization, livestreaming, or another runtime choice requires Kit; "
"otherwise OVRTX is used for a fully kit-less run."
msgstr ""
"自动选择 RTX 系列实现。物理、可视化、直播流或其他运行时选项需要 Kit 时，使用 Isaac Sim RTX；否则使用 OVRTX，实现完全不依赖"
" Kit 的运行。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:163
msgid "``newton_renderer``"
msgstr "``newton_renderer``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:164
msgid "Newton Warp renderer."
msgstr "Newton Warp 渲染器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:165
msgid "``ovrtx``"
msgstr "``ovrtx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:166
msgid ""
"Concrete OVRTX renderer configuration for supported kit-less workflows."
msgstr "明确指定的 OVRTX 渲染器配置，适用于受支持且不依赖 Kit 的工作流程。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:168
msgid ""
"Automatic selectors such as ``physics=physx`` and ``renderer=rtx`` are opt-"
"in. Defaults are concrete so that running a task without selectors is "
"predictable. A solver is not a separate backend: ``newton_mjwarp`` and "
"``newton_kamino`` both use Newton but configure different solvers."
msgstr ""
"``physics=physx`` 和 ``renderer=rtx`` "
"等自动选择器需显式启用。默认值均明确指定具体实现，保证不传选择器时的任务行为可预测。求解器不等于独立后端： ``newton_mjwarp`` 和 "
"``newton_kamino`` 都使用 Newton，只是配置了不同的求解器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:175
msgid "Defaults, presets, and fine-tuning"
msgstr "默认值、预设与微调"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:177
msgid ""
"A preset replaces the complete configuration section at its location; it "
"does not merge fields from two alternatives. Isaac Lab resolves "
"configuration in this order:"
msgstr "预设会替换所在位置的整个配置部分，而不会合并两个备选配置的字段。Isaac Lab 按以下顺序解析配置："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:181
msgid "Apply each preset config's ``default`` choice."
msgstr "应用各预设配置中的 ``default`` 选项。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:182
msgid "Apply global choices from ``presets=...``."
msgstr "应用 ``presets=...`` 指定的全局选项。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:183
msgid ""
"Apply a preset targeted at a specific path, such as "
"``env.sim.physics=newton_mjwarp``."
msgstr "应用针对特定路径的预设，例如 ``env.sim.physics=newton_mjwarp`` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:185
msgid "Apply scalar Hydra overrides, such as ``env.sim.dt=0.002``."
msgstr "应用 Hydra 标量覆盖项，例如 ``env.sim.dt=0.002`` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:187
msgid ""
"The last step makes it easy to start from a maintained preset and tune one "
"value:"
msgstr "最后一步便于在已有维护的预设基础上调整单个值："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:196
msgid ""
"Prefer ``physics=`` and ``renderer=`` for backend choices because they state"
" intent clearly. Use ``presets=`` for task-specific modes or when one name "
"must update several matching sections together. Use a path selector only "
"when you intend to replace one particular section."
msgstr ""
"选择后端时，优先使用 ``physics=`` 和 ``renderer=`` "
"，意图更清晰。任务专用模式，或需要用同一个名称同时更新多个匹配配置部分时，使用 ``presets=`` "
"。只有想替换某个特定配置部分时，才使用路径选择器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:203
msgid ""
"Keep behavior-changing presets the same when loading a checkpoint. An "
"observation preset can change tensor shapes, and a policy trained with one "
"observation mode may not load with another."
msgstr "加载检查点时，应保持会影响行为的预设与训练时一致。观测预设可能改变张量形状，使用一种观测模式训练的策略，未必能在另一种模式下加载。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:209
msgid "How task authors expose choices"
msgstr "任务开发者如何提供选项"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:211
msgid ""
"Task authors define alternatives with "
":class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg` and choose one as the "
"default. For a multi-backend task, the preset wrapper belongs in "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg`:"
msgstr ""
"任务开发者通过 :class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg` "
"定义备选配置，并选定一个默认值。对于多后端任务，预设包装器应放在 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` 中："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:243
msgid ""
"Keep backend-specific values inside named configurations whenever possible. "
"This keeps task logic shared and makes every supported choice visible from "
"the command line."
msgstr "尽可能将后端专用值放在具名配置中。这样可以共享任务逻辑，并让命令行显示所有受支持的选项。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:247
msgid ""
"When backend selection must also change simulation-wide settings such as the"
" time step, a physics preset may instead contain complete ``SimulationCfg`` "
"alternatives. The ``physics=`` selector recognizes these bundles from their "
"``physics`` field and applies the complete matching simulation "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"如果后端选择还必须改变时间步长等仿真全局设置，物理预设也可以包含完整的 ``SimulationCfg`` 备选配置。 ``physics=`` "
"选择器会通过其中的 ``physics`` 字段识别这些组合，并应用完整的匹配仿真配置。"

